    "在 Google Cloud 注册 iOS OAuth client，Bundle ID 为 com.tokenpulse.app。需开启 Google 账户授权并授予页面列出的权限。使用自己的 client ID，无需 client secret。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Register an iOS OAuth client in Google Cloud with Bundle ID com.tokenpulse.app. Enable Google account authorization and grant the permissions listed on the page. Use your own client ID; no client secret is needed."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在 Google Cloud 注册 iOS OAuth client，Bundle ID 为 com.tokenpulse.app。需开启 Google 账户授权并授予页面列出的权限。使用自己的 client ID，无需 client secret。"
          }
        }
      }
