      }
    },
    "输入 TeamID:ManagementKey，使用英文冒号。需要管理 Key 和账单读取权限，推理 Key 无效。余额是已入账值，账期内可能高于控制台实时余额。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Enter TeamID:ManagementKey using a colon (:). A Management Key with billing read permission is required; inference Keys cannot be used. The balance is the posted ledger value and may exceed the console’s live balance during the billing period."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
