    "通用 API Key 输入 apikey:Key；登录 JWT 输入 token:JWT。推理专用 Key 不适用。各实例和团队的 Bobcoins 预算分别展示，不换算成货币。登录 token 到期后需更新。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "For a general API Key, enter apikey:Key; for a login JWT, enter token:JWT. Inference-only Keys cannot be used. Bobcoins budgets are shown separately for each instance and team, without currency conversion. Update the login Token when it expires."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "通用 API Key 输入 apikey:Key；登录 JWT 输入 token:JWT。推理专用 Key 不适用。各实例和团队的 Bobcoins 预算分别展示，不换算成货币。登录 token 到期后需更新。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
